From 4d4ad2db78acd2a7e82cdc1a9a88ffb1edb6be43 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: raold <868138+raold@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:35:33 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Keep every healer but one on Valithria, out of the portals,
 and in mana

Playerbots.ValithriaHealerFocus (default 1). With three healers on 10-player heroic the two dragon
healers spent every 45 s portal cycle in the dream, where bots cannot collect the clouds and the
heroic Nightmare clouds stack Twisted Nightmares, a damage over time; the paladin ran dry in 50 s
because her heal (ACTION_RAID + 2) outranks every class mana cooldown.

- One raid healer at any size and difficulty; every other healer heals her.
- No healer bot uses a Dream or Nightmare portal; healers return to her side while portals are up.
- icc valithria mana (ACTION_RAID + 3): Divine Plea below 65% mana, Shadowfiend below 60% and Hymn
  of Hope below 25%, Mana Tide Totem and Innervate below 50%.
- valithria_watch gains focus=, valithria_healer gains mana_cd=.
- 0 restores the earlier allocation and portal use.
